    "text": "package Int_Arrays is\n\n   type Integer_Arr is\n     array (Positive range <>) of Integer;\n\n   function Is_Zero (A : Integer_Arr)\n                     return Boolean is\n      (for all E of A => E = 0);\n\n   function Has_Zero (A : Integer_Arr)\n                      return Boolean is\n      (for some E of A => E = 0);\n\nend Int_Arrays;\n",
